    "media:imagetext": "O\nSpecial Savings for families. The head pays\nfull fare, the spouse and children 13-19 pay\n2/3 fare, children 2-12 pay ½ fare, and\nCommuter Fare Discounts..\ninfants travel free. Military personnel in\nuniform pay ½ fare on a space\n• available basis.\nThe only airline flying non-stop between\nSan Diego and San Jose. Save thirty\nminutes minimum en route. That's a half\nhour more of sack time in the morning or\nHour Power....\nconference time in the afternoon. Of course,\nif you enjoy lots of take-offs and landings\n• • you don't have to fly with us.\nWe have the best record in the industry.\nOther airlines make this claim, but they're\nwrong. Our flights arrive and depart on-time\nOn-Time Dependability..\n(within 15 minutes of scheduled departure )\n94 per cent of the time. You can schedule\n• • • your meetings with confidence.\nOur stewardesses are hired for their\npersonalities as well as their attractiveness.\nThey are encouraged to be themselves.\nThey are interested in you and they are\nInformality......•\ninteresting ... when they get a minute, they\nlove to chat. Many of our passengers are\n• • • on a first name basis.\nThe only airline flying from San Diego to\nOakland and San Jose that records your\nname on a flight manifest. This is not\nimportant to you on light travel days.\nConfirmed Reservations...• have a seat on the arcat.\nBut on heavy periods such as Fridays and\nSundays it is your only assurance you'll\nSome of our flights stop at Orange County\nfor a few minutes. We call them \"Fun Stops\"\nbecause that's what happens. We have wine\nEntertaining Service..\ntasters, sing alongs, frisbee contests on the\nramp, tours of our operations room. We are\n•\n• • dedicated to eliminating boredom aboard",
